    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n68465" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μονᾰχ-ός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μόνος</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unique</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				1040a29
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στερεὰ μ.</span> a
			<i>single</i> set of solids, ib.<i><span class="en">
				1076b29
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅσα μ. ἔχει συμφωνίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					2p.36U.
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ σπλάγχνα ἔχειν μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					2.58
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Apollod.
				<u>Poliorc.</u>
				181.10
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. τέκνα</span>
			<i>only</i> children, <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Tetr.</u>
				190
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ μ.</span>
			<i>individual cases</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Sign.</u>
				14
			</span></i>, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ μ.</span>
			<i>uniqueness</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				6.8.7
			</span></i>. Adv. -
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					1p.30U.
				</span></i>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>solitary, deserted</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μοναχῷ ἐνὶ</span>
			<i>rure</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κρεβέννου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aus.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					8.23
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of legal
			documents, <i>executed in a single copy</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				13.16
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>, etc. Adv. -
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Sammelb.</u>
					5810.20
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iv A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst., <i>monk,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				11.384
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Pall.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Procop.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				1.7
			</span></i>.</div>
